---
import PolicyLayout from '@/components/PolicyLayout.astro';
---

<PolicyLayout title="Delivery & payment">
  <p class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-mark"></span> Ordering with Yong Farm</p>
  <h1 class="policy-title">Delivery &amp; payment</h1>
  <p class="policy-intro">Every online order starts as a request. Our team confirms availability, delivery details and the final total with you before the order is confirmed.</p>

  <div class="policy-grid">
    <article class="policy-card">
      <span class="policy-number">01</span>
      <h2>Delivery area</h2>
      <p>Share your address in the order form. We’ll confirm whether delivery is available for your location.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="policy-card">
      <span class="policy-number">02</span>
      <h2>Fee &amp; timing</h2>
      <p>Delivery charges and an estimated delivery time are confirmed individually. Delivery is not included in the egg-price estimate.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="policy-card">
      <span class="policy-number">03</span>
      <h2>Payment</h2>
      <p>No payment is collected through this website. Our team will share the available payment method after confirming your order details.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="policy-card">
      <span class="policy-number">04</span>
      <h2>Changes or damaged eggs</h2>
      <p>Please contact us as soon as possible. We’ll review each case with you; cancellation and replacement terms are currently handled individually.</p>
    </article>
  </div>

  <aside class="policy-notice">
    <strong>Before you order</strong>
    <p>Delivery coverage, fees, timing and payment options are not fixed on this page yet. We’ll confirm them directly before accepting an order.</p>
  </aside>
  <p class="policy-contact">Need help? <a href="https://wa.me/60123456789" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Chat with our farm team on WhatsApp</a>.</p>
</PolicyLayout>
